                  <entry>Authorization</entry>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>HTTP Basic Authentication: Create a basic authentication header from your client_id and client_secret using the rules of HTTP basic authentication. The header field should be Authorization: Basic {credentials} where credentials is the Base64 encoding of client_id and client_secret joined by a single colon :.</entry>
